XC       37      IT WAS ALREADY UNLOCKED.
XC       55      YOU CAN'T UNLOCK THE KEYS.
XC       171     THE CHAIN IS NOW UNLOCKED.
XC       172     THE CHAIN IS NOW LOCKED.
