X93300   CALL RSPEAK(254)
X       GOTO 95000
XC  "YOU'RE DEAD, FRED."         "YOU DIED, CLYDE?"
XC
XC  IF THE CURRENT LOC IS ZERO, IT MEANS THE CLOWN GOT HIMSELF KILLED.  WE'LL
